  "upstream_preserved": true,
  "modifications": [
    "Original extractor does not export non-picture native geometry or recognize Akxan free text boxes as title placeholders; separate native-shapes.json records actual OOXML geometry/font data and generates SVG without guessing shapes.",
    "Original complete viewport CSS and real Neon preview navigation/FX are retained; footer/HUD/dot labels localized to Japanese and Studio Yebisu.",
    "Mandatory AWS affiliation-looking footer replaced under explicit no-officiality instruction. No AWS logo/brand/service icons used.",
    "Full local TTF embedded in single HTML instead of remote fonts/Lucide CDN; input contains no raster images, icons or new licensed assets.",
    "Original intersection observer additionally clears visible on leave to replay geometry explanation; same-origin minimal player adapter and page counter recorded in source/controller.diff.",
    "Original gen-content.py is a new-presentation-only path and is not executed for this PPT conversion.",
    "PPT source geometry remains inside a fixed SVG viewBox, scaled by viewport; HTML page sizes/spacing use original clamp/breakpoints."
  ],
